<title>INDIA: India's RBI repos auctions calendar for March.</title>
<headline>India's RBI repos auctions calendar for March.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) on Thursday announced the schedule for repos auctions in March.</p>
<p>The repos auctions will be open to parties holding SGL account and current account with the RBI.</p>
<p>The following are the details of the auction.</p>
<p>Date of auction  Date of payment   Period  Repurchase date</p>
<p>-----------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>March    1	 March    3	  3 days  March    6</p>
<p>March    5	 March    6	  4 days  March    10</p>
<p>March    8	 March    10	 3 days  March    13</p>
<p>March    12	March    13	 4 days  March    17</p>
<p>March    15	March    17	 4 days  March    21</p>
<p>March    20	March    21	 4 days  March    25</p>
<p>March    22	March    25	 4 days  March    29</p>
<p>March    27	March    29	 3 days  April    1</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
